#: docking/core/tips.py:57
msgid "Open the dock menu from anywhere"
msgstr "Åbn dock-menuen hvor som helst"

#: docking/core/tips.py:59
msgid ""
"Hold Ctrl and right-click anywhere on the shelf to open the dock menu. This "
"is the quickest path to Preferences, Applets, Diagnostics, and Quit when "
"there is no empty space near the icons."
msgstr ""
"Hold Ctrl nede, og højreklik hvor som helst på hylden for at åbne dock-"
"menuen. Dette er den hurtigste vej til Præferencer, Applets, Diagnostik og "
"Afslut, når der ikke er tom plads i nærheden af ​​ikonerne."

#: docking/core/tips.py:67
msgid "Start with Preferences"
msgstr "Start med præferencer"

#: docking/core/tips.py:69
msgid ""
"Use Preferences to adjust position, monitor behavior, icon size, zoom, "
"hiding, themes, previews, tooltips, and click actions. It is the best first "
"stop when the dock does not feel quite right."
msgstr ""
"Brug Præferencer til at justere position, monitoradfærd, ikonstørrelse, "
"zoom, skjul, temaer, forhåndsvisninger, værktøjstip og klikhandlinger. Det "
"er det bedste første stop, når kajen ikke føles helt rigtig."

#: docking/core/tips.py:76
msgid "Add applets from the dock menu"
msgstr "Tilføj applets fra dock-menuen"

#: docking/core/tips.py:78
msgid ""
"Right-click the shelf background and choose Add Applet to add launchers, "
"system status, media controls, productivity helpers, and small utility tools "
"directly to the dock."
msgstr ""
"Højreklik på hyldebaggrunden, og vælg Tilføj applet for at tilføje startere, "
"systemstatus, mediekontroller, produktivitetshjælpere og små hjælpeværktøjer "
"direkte til docken."

#: docking/core/tips.py:85
msgid "Use separators for organization"
msgstr "Brug separatorer til organisation"

#: docking/core/tips.py:87
msgid ""
"Right-click where a divider should go and choose Add Separator. Separators "
"make it easier to keep pinned apps, folders, and applets in clear groups."
msgstr ""
"Højreklik, hvor en skillelinje skal gå, og vælg Tilføj separator. "
"Separatorer gør det nemmere at holde fastgjorte apps, mapper og applets i "
"klare grupper."

#: docking/core/tips.py:94
msgid "Pin running apps"
msgstr "Fastgør kørende apps"

#: docking/core/tips.py:96
msgid ""
"Right-click a running app and choose Keep in Dock. The launcher will stay "
"available after the app closes, so you can start it again with one click."
msgstr ""
"Højreklik på en kørende app, og vælg Behold i Dock. Starteren forbliver "
"tilgængelig, når appen lukker, så du kan starte den igen med et enkelt klik."

#: docking/core/tips.py:103
msgid "Remove pinned items quickly"
msgstr "Fjern fastgjorte elementer hurtigt"

#: docking/core/tips.py:105
msgid ""
"Right-click a pinned item and choose Remove from Dock, or drag unlocked "
"items off the dock. Removing a launcher does not uninstall the application "
"or delete your files."
msgstr ""
"Højreklik på et fastgjort element, og vælg Fjern fra Dock, eller træk ulåste "
"elementer ud af docken. Fjernelse af en launcher afinstallerer ikke "
"programmet eller sletter dine filer."

#: docking/core/tips.py:112
msgid "Drop items onto the dock"
msgstr "Smid genstande ned på kajen"

#: docking/core/tips.py:114
msgid ""
"Drag applications, .desktop files, files, folders, and AppImages onto "
"Docking to pin them. Dropped folders become folder stacks, and dropped "
"AppImages can get their own launcher."
msgstr ""
"Træk applikationer, .desktop-filer, filer, mapper og AppImages til docking "
"for at fastgøre dem. Tabte mapper bliver mappestakke, og tabte AppImages kan "
"få deres egen launcher."

#: docking/core/tips.py:121
msgid "Open files with dock apps"
msgstr "Åbn filer med dock-apps"

#: docking/core/tips.py:123
msgid ""
"Drag a file onto an application icon to open it with that app. This is "
"useful when the file manager would otherwise choose the wrong default "
"application."
msgstr ""
"Træk en fil til et programikon for at åbne den med den pågældende app. Dette "
"er nyttigt, når filhåndteringen ellers ville vælge det forkerte "
"standardprogram."

#: docking/core/tips.py:130
msgid "Use folder stacks"
msgstr "Brug mappestabler"

#: docking/core/tips.py:132
msgid ""
"Pin a folder and click it from the dock to browse its contents without "
"opening a file manager first. It works well for common places like "
"Downloads, Projects, and screenshots."
msgstr ""
"Fastgør en mappe, og klik på den fra docken for at gennemse dens indhold "
"uden først at åbne en filhåndtering. Det fungerer godt til almindelige "
"steder som downloads, projekter og skærmbilleder."

#: docking/core/tips.py:139
msgid "Tune folder stack behavior"
msgstr "Tune mappe stak adfærd"

#: docking/core/tips.py:141
msgid ""
"Right-click a pinned folder to sort contents, show hidden files, or "
"customize its icon. These options let each stack behave like the folder it "
"represents."
msgstr ""
"Højreklik på en fastgjort mappe for at sortere indhold, vise skjulte filer "
"eller tilpasse dens ikon. Disse muligheder lader hver stak opføre sig som "
"den mappe, den repræsenterer."

#: docking/core/tips.py:148
msgid "Keep mounted devices within reach"
msgstr "Hold monterede enheder inden for rækkevidde"

#: docking/core/tips.py:150
msgid ""
"Add the Devices applet to browse every mounted device in a live stack. "
"Mounts appear and disappear automatically, and Preferences -> Behavior "
"controls whether stacks open on hover or click."
msgstr "Tilføj Enheder-appletten for at gennemse alle monterede enheder i en "
"dynamisk stak. Montering vises og forsvinder automatisk, og Indstillinger -> "
"Adfærd styrer, om stakke åbnes ved at holde musen over eller ved klik."

#: docking/core/tips.py:158
msgid "Follow news sources by country"
msgstr "Følg nyhedskilder efter land"

#: docking/core/tips.py:160
msgid ""
"Add the News applet, choose a country, and select a publication or edition. "
"Scroll through its latest headlines, or add more sources and switch between "
"them from the applet menu."
msgstr "Tilføj Nyheder-appletten, vælg et land, og vælg en publikation eller "
"udgave. Rul gennem de seneste overskrifter, eller tilføj flere kilder, og "
"skift mellem dem fra appletmenuen."

#: docking/core/tips.py:167
msgid "Customize pinned icons"
msgstr "Tilpas fastgjorte ikoner"

#: docking/core/tips.py:169
msgid ""
"Right-click a pinned app, file, or folder and use Icon -> Choose From File. "
"Custom icons are stored in Docking's config, so the original desktop file or "
"file on disk is left untouched."
msgstr ""
"Højreklik på en fastgjort app, fil eller mappe, og brug Ikon -> Vælg fra "
"fil. Brugerdefinerede ikoner gemmes i Dockings konfiguration, så den "
"originale skrivebordsfil eller fil på disken forbliver urørt."

#: docking/core/tips.py:176
msgid "Use the Applications applet search"
msgstr "Brug applet-søgningen Applications"

#: docking/core/tips.py:178
msgid ""
"Add the Applications applet, open it, and type to filter installed apps. It "
"gives you a compact launcher menu without leaving the dock."
msgstr ""
"Tilføj appletten Applications, åbn den, og skriv for at filtrere "
"installerede apps. Det giver dig en kompakt startmenu uden at forlade docken."

#: docking/core/tips.py:185
msgid "Drag apps straight to the dock"
msgstr "Træk programmer direkte til docken"

#: docking/core/tips.py:187
msgid ""
"Open the Applications applet and drag any application from its menu onto the "
"shelf. Drop it where you want its launcher to stay in the dock."
msgstr "Åbn Programmer-appletten, og træk et program fra menuen over på "
"hylden. Slip det, hvor du vil have starteren til at blive i docken."

#: docking/core/tips.py:194
msgid "Keep WhatsApp in the dock"
msgstr "Behold WhatsApp i docken"

#: docking/core/tips.py:196
msgid ""
"Add the WhatsApp applet for a persistent WhatsApp Web window, desktop "
"notifications, and an unread-message badge. Closing the window hides it "
"without signing out."
msgstr "Tilføj WhatsApp-appletten for et vedvarende WhatsApp Web-vindue, "
"skrivebordsunderretninger og et badge for ulæste beskeder. Lukning af "
"vinduet skjuler det uden at logge ud."

#: docking/core/tips.py:203
msgid "Use Run Application like Alt+F2"
msgstr "Brug Kør applikation som Alt+F2"

#: docking/core/tips.py:205
msgid ""
"Add Run Application to launch commands, apps, and terminal commands from the "
"dock. As you type, matching applications are shown so you can launch by name "
"or run a standalone command."
msgstr ""
"Tilføj Run Application for at starte kommandoer, apps og terminalkommandoer "
"fra docken. Mens du skriver, vises matchende applikationer, så du kan starte "
"med navn eller køre en selvstændig kommando."

#: docking/core/tips.py:212
msgid "Use window previews"
msgstr "Brug vindueseksempler"

#: docking/core/tips.py:214
msgid ""
"Hover running apps to inspect open windows before switching. Previews help "
"when one application has several windows open."
msgstr ""
"Hold musemarkøren over kørende apps for at inspicere åbne vinduer, før du "
"skifter. Forhåndsvisninger hjælper, når et program har flere vinduer åbne."

#: docking/core/tips.py:220
msgid "Choose your click behavior"
msgstr "Vælg din klikadfærd"

#: docking/core/tips.py:222
msgid ""
"Preferences -> Behavior lets left click toggle, cycle, or focus the most "
"recent window. Pick the behavior that matches how you switch between running "
"applications."
msgstr ""
"Præferencer -> Adfærd lader venstreklik skifte, skifte mellem eller fokusere "
"det seneste vindue. Vælg den adfærd, der passer til, hvordan du skifter "
"mellem kørende programmer."

#: docking/core/tips.py:229
msgid "Ctrl-click opens a new window"
msgstr "Ctrl-klik åbner et nyt vindue"

#: docking/core/tips.py:231
msgid ""
"Hold Ctrl while clicking an app icon to launch another window. This works "
"even when the app is already running and a normal click would focus it."
msgstr ""
"Hold Ctrl nede, mens du klikker på et appikon for at åbne et andet vindue. "
"Dette virker, selv når appen allerede kører, og et normalt klik ville "
"fokusere den."

#: docking/core/tips.py:238
msgid "Use Clock as a calendar"
msgstr "Brug Ur som kalender"

#: docking/core/tips.py:240
msgid ""
"Left-click the Clock applet to open the same calendar popup as the Calendar "
"applet. Use Clock when you want the time and calendar in one dock item."
msgstr "Venstreklik på Ur-appletten for at åbne samme kalenderpopup som "
"Kalender-appletten. Brug Ur, når du vil have tid og kalender i ét "
"dockelement."

#: docking/core/tips.py:247
msgid "Use app right-click menus"
msgstr "Brug app-højreklik-menuer"

#: docking/core/tips.py:249
msgid ""
"Right-click apps for desktop actions, open windows, recent documents, "
"pinning, and close actions. Many apps expose useful shortcuts there, such as "
"opening a private window or composing a new message."
msgstr ""
"Højreklik på apps til skrivebordshandlinger, åbne vinduer, seneste "
"dokumenter, fastgørelse og lukhandlinger. Mange apps viser nyttige genveje "
"der, såsom at åbne et privat vindue eller skrive en ny besked."

#: docking/core/tips.py:257
msgid "Use Recent Files"
msgstr "Brug Seneste filer"

#: docking/core/tips.py:259
msgid ""
"Add the Recent Files applet to jump back into documents you used recently. "
"It is a faster path when you remember the file, not the folder."
msgstr ""
"Tilføj appletten Seneste filer for at hoppe tilbage til dokumenter, du har "
"brugt for nylig. Det er en hurtigere sti, når du husker filen, ikke mappen."

#: docking/core/tips.py:266
msgid "Use System Tray when needed"
msgstr "Brug systembakken, når det er nødvendigt"

#: docking/core/tips.py:268
msgid ""
"Add System Tray for tray/status apps and use its menu to manage tray "
"ownership when supported. This helps with legacy apps that still rely on a "
"classic notification area."
msgstr ""
"Tilføj systembakke til bakke-/statusapps, og brug dens menu til at "
"administrere bakkeejerskab, når det understøttes. Dette hjælper med ældre "
"apps, der stadig er afhængige af et klassisk meddelelsesområde."

#: docking/core/tips.py:275
msgid "Use Diagnostics for support"
msgstr "Brug Diagnostik til support"

#: docking/core/tips.py:277
msgid ""
"Open Diagnostics before filing an issue to copy backend, session, and "
"feature details. Including that report makes it much easier to understand "
"compositor, monitor, and environment-specific problems."
msgstr ""
"Åbn Diagnostik, før du indgiver et problem for at kopiere backend-, "
"sessions- og funktionsdetaljer. At inkludere denne rapport gør det meget "
"lettere at forstå kompositor-, monitor- og miljøspecifikke problemer."

